    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39633" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικατα-φέρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fell, knock down on top of</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Descr.</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>fall down upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					12.9.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. 
				Pass.
			, of stars, <i>follow the sun</i>, <i><span class="en">
