				22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φερόμενον, τό</span>, name of eighth <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόπος</span>, Thrasyll. in <u>Cat.Cod.</u>
